name: Unsupported strategy controls stop before discovery and preserve explicit recovery
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/strategy_controls.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
submit: run agentic-sast:scan {"dryRun":true}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/strategy_controls.py @TMP_TARGET @ART dry-run
paste-file: @ART/dry-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Outcome · blocked | dry-run-refusal
expect: REPLAY · Summary
expect: requires strategy=chunked
expect: No model request started.
expect-not: sha256:
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/strategy_controls.py @TMP_TARGET @ART reading
resize: 160x48
live-snap: refusal-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: refusal-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: refusal-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: refusal-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: refusal-40x12
expect: Tab receipt
keys: NPage
wait: 0.2
live-snap: refusal-reading-40x12
keys: NPage
wait: 0.2
live-snap: refusal-reading-40x12-2
keys: Tab
resize: 120x36
require-live-snap: 25 REPLAY · Full receipt | full-receipt
expect: sha256:
resize: 160x48
live-snap: full-receipt-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: full-receipt-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: full-receipt-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: full-receipt-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: full-receipt-40x12
expect: Tab summary
keys: NPage
wait: 0.2
live-snap: full-receipt-reading-40x12
keys: BTab
wait: 0.2
live-snap: restored-summary-40x12
ask: Across six sizes, is the failure summary readable, does Tab expose the complete receipt and does Shift+Tab restore the exact summary reading position?
resize: 120x36
keys: PPage PPage PPage
paste-file: @ART/draft.txt
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 retained 資料 draft | prompt-draft-retained
expect-not: REPLAY · Full receipt
keys: C-u
keys: Escape
submit: use agentic-sast
submit: options agentic-sast:scan
submit: setg dryRun true
submit: logs
submit: run agentic-sast:scan {}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/strategy_controls.py @TMP_TARGET @ART stored
require-live-snap: 25 option dryRun requires strategy=chunked | stored-refusal
submit: options agentic-sast:scan
submit: unsetg dryRun
submit: logs
submit: run agentic-sast:scan {"scopeFile":"scope.txt"}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/strategy_controls.py @TMP_TARGET @ART scope
require-live-snap: 25 option scopeFile requires strategy=chunked | scope-refusal
submit: run agentic-sast:scan {"budgetUsd":0.01}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/strategy_controls.py @TMP_TARGET @ART budget
require-live-snap: 25 option budgetUsd requires strategy=chunked | budget-refusal
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/strategy_controls.py @TMP_TARGET @ART cleared
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Displayed Scan: blocked | blocked-report
expect: 0 findings
expect-not: Displayed Scan: completed
ask: Is removing the stored setting an explicit recovery action, with all four refusals retained and no strategy change, scan or spending implied?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/dry-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Outcome · blocked | restarted-refusal
expect: REPLAY · Summary
expect: No model request started.
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 25 REPLAY · Full receipt | restarted-full-receipt
expect: sha256:
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/strategy_controls.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain the refusal history and cleared setting without granting work or calls?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
